hadiths[28]{hadithnumber,text}:
"399","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ham sab se peechay hain aur qayamat ke din sab se aagay ho janay walay hain. Aur ham jannat mein sab se pehle daakhil hon ge. Magar albatta itni baat hai ke un logon ko kitab ham se pehle mili hai aur hamein un ke baad mili. Aur unhon ne sachi baat mein ikhtilaf kiya so ye Juma ka din wohi hai jis mein unhon ne ikhtilaf kiya aur Allah ne hamein hidayat di. Phir ye Juma ka din to hamaray liye aur doosra din Yahud ka, yani hafta, aur teesra din Nasara ka, yani itwaar, jo unhon ne apne liye muqarrar kiye. (Muslim: 3/7). Baab: Juma ke din ki fazilat."
"400","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Un dinon mein se behtar din, jin mein sooraj nikalta hai, Juma ka din hai. Usi din Adam (alaihissalam) paida hue aur usi din jannat mein daakhil kiye gaye aur usi din wahan se nikalay gaye. Aur qayamat bhi usi Juma ke din qaim ho gi. (Muslim: 3/6). Baab: Juma ke din ki saat ke baaray mein."
"401","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abul Qasim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Juma mein aik saat aisi hai ke jo Musalman us waqt khara namaz padhta ho aur Allah se koi bhalayi ki cheez maangay to beshak Allah Taala us ko ataa karay ga. Aur, rawi ne, kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne haath se ishara kiya ke wo bohat thori hai aur us ki raghbat dilatay thay. (Muslim: 3/5)"
"402","[AI-translation] Abu Burda bin Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujh se Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke tum ne apne walid se Juma ki saat ke baaray mein kuch suna hai jo wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kartay hon? Main ne kaha ke haan main ne un se suna hai, wo kehtay thay ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke wo ghari Imam ke khutba ke liye baithnay se namaz padhi janay tak hai. (Muslim: 3/6). (Daraqutni ne is par tanqeed ki, sahih ye hai ke ye Abu Burda par mauqoof hai.)"
"403","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Juma ke din Fajr ki namaz mein Alif Laam Meem Sajda aur Hal ata alal insaan heenum minad dahr padhtay thay aur namaz-e-Juma mein Surah Juma aur Munafiqoon padha kartay thay. (Muslim: 2/16). Baab: Juma ke ghusl ke baaray mein."
"404","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar (raziyallahu anhu) aik din logon ko Juma ka khutba de rahay thay ke Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) aaye aur Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne un ki taraf ishara kartay hue kaha ke kya haal ho ga un logon ka jo azaan ke baad dair lagatay hain? To Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Ameer-ul-Momineen! Jab main ne azaan suni to aur kuch nahi kiya siwa wuzu ke, ke wuzu kiya aur aaya. Umar Farooq (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke sirf wuzu hi kiya? Kya logon ne nahi suna ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke jab koi Juma ko aaye to zaroor nahaye. (Muslim: 3/3). Baab: Juma ke din khushbu aur miswaak."
"405","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Juma ke din nahana aur miswaak karna har baligh par wajib hai. Aur khushbu mayassar ho to wo bhi lagani chahiye. (Muslim: 3/4). Baab: Juma ke din jaldi aanay ki fazilat."
"406","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab Juma ka din hota hai to masjid ke darwazon mein se har darwaza par farishtay likhtay hain ke falan sab se pehle aaya, us ke baad wo aaya, us ke baad wo aaya, phir jab Imam mimbar par baith jata hai to sab farishtay aamaal naamay lapait detay hain aur aa kar khutba sunnay lagtay hain. Aur jo awwal waqt aaya us ke sawab ki misaal aisi hai jaisay koi aik oont ki qurbani karay. Us ke baad jo aaya wo aisa hai jaisay koi aik gaaye qurban karay. Us ke baad jo aaye wo aisay hai jaisay maindha qurban karay. Us ke baad jo aaye wo aisa hai jaisay koi murghi qurban karay. Us ke baad jo aaye wo aisa hai jaisay koi aik anda Allah ki raah mein qurban karay. (Muslim: 3/8). Baab: Juma ki namaz jab sooraj dhal jaye. (Muhajjir se murad jaldi aanay wala hai.)"
"407","[AI-translation] Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Juma us waqt padhtay thay jab sooraj dhal jata tha. Phir saya dhoondtay hue laut-tay thay, yani deewaron ka saya na hota tha. (Muslim: 3/9). (Nujammiu se murad Juma padhna hai; Muslim mein natatabbau hai.)"
"408","[AI-translation] Abu Hazim se riwayat hai ke kuch log Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaye aur mimbar ke baaray mein jhagarnay lagay ke wo kis lakri ka tha. Unhon ne kaha ke main janta hun wo jis lakri ka tha aur jis ne usay banaya. Aur main ne dekha jab pehli baar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us par baithay. Abu Hazim kehtay hain: Main ne kaha ke Ae Abu Abbas! Ham se ye sab haal bayan kijiye. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik aurat ko kehla bheja, Abu Hazim ne kaha ke Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) us din us aurat ka naam le rahay thay, ke tu apne ghulam ko jo barhayi hai itni fursat de ke mere liye chand lakriyan yani mimbar bana de ke jis par main logon se baat karun, yani waz o nasihat karun. To us ghulam ne teen seerhiyon ka aik mimbar banaya aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hukm kiya to wo masjid mein us maqam par rakha gaya. Us ki lakri ghaba ke jhao ki thi, ghaba Madina ki bulandi mein aik maqam hai. Aur main ne dekha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us par kharay hue aur takbeer kahi. Logon ne bhi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechay takbeer kahi aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mimbar par thay. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ruku se sar uthaya aur ultay paon peechay utray yahan tak ke mimbar ki jar mein sajda kiya. Phir mimbar par lautay yahan tak ke namaz se farigh hue. Us ke baad Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya ke Ae logon! Main ne ye is liye kiya ke tum meri pairwi karo aur meri tarah namaz padhna seekho. (Muslim). Baab: Khutba mein kya kaha jaye. (Salah darjaat ka lafz Ahl-e-Arab ke khilaf hai; qamoos-ul-bahr ke baaray mein Ibn Aseer ne kaha tasheef hai.)"
"409","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Zimad, aik shakhs ka naam hai, Makka mein aaya aur wo qabeela Azd Shanooa mein se tha aur jinon aur aaseeb waghera se dam jhaar karta tha. To us ne Makka ke nadaanon se suna ke Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), maazAllah, majnoon hain. To us ne kaha ke main us shakhs ko dekhun ga shayad Allah Taala mere haath se unhein acha kar de. Gharz Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mila aur kaha ke Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Main jinon waghera ke asar se jhaar karta hun aur Allah Taala mere haath se jisay chahta hai shifa deta hai, to kya Aap ko khwahish hai? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke: Sab khoobiyan Allah ke liye hain, main us ki khoobiyan bayan karta hun aur us se madad chahta hun jis ko Allah raah batlaye usay kaun behka sakta hai aur jisay wo behkaye usay kaun raah batla sakta hai? Aur main gawahi deta hun ke Allah Taala ke siwa koi ibadat ke laiq nahi aur Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke banday aur bhejay hue, Rasool, hain. Ab hamd ke baad jo, kaho kahun. Zimad ne kaha ke in kalimaat ko phir padho. Gharz ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne in kalimaat ko teen baar padha. Phir Zimad ne kaha ke main ne kahinon ki baatein sunein, jadugaron ke aqwaal sunay, shairon ke ashaar sunay magar in kalimaat ke barabar main ne kisi ko nahi suna, aur ye to darya-e-balaghat ki teh tak pahunch gaye hain. Phir Zimad ne kaha ke apna haath laiye ke main Islam ki baiat karun. Gharz unhon ne baiat ki. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main tum se tumhari qaum, ki taraf, se bhi baiat kar lun? Unhon ne arz kiya ke haan, main apni qaum ki taraf se bhi baiat karta hun. Rawi kehta hai aakhir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik fauji dasta bheja aur wo un, Zimad, ki qaum par se guzray to us lashkar ke sardaar ne kaha ke tum ne is qaum se to kuch nahi loota? Tab aik shakhs ne kaha ke haan main ne aik lota un se liya hai. Unhon ne hukm diya ke jao usay wapas kar do is liye ke ye Zimad ki qaum hai, aur wo Zimad ki baiat ke sabab se amaan mein aa chukay hain. (Muslim). (Reeh se murad jinoon ka asar hai.)"
"410","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab khutba padhtay to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aankhein surkh ho jatin aur aawaz buland ho jati aur ghussa zyada ho jata. Goya wo aik aisay lashkar se daranay walay thay ke subah aaya ya shaam aaya aur farmatay thay ke main aur qayamat yun ikathay bhejay gaye hain jaisay ye do ungliyan, aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ungasht-e-shahadat aur darmiyani ungli mila dikhatay aur hamd o sana ke baad farmatay ke jaan lo ke har baat se behtar Allah ki kitab hai aur sab se behtar Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka rasta hai. Aur sab kaamon se buray naye kaam hain aur ibadat ka har naya tareeqa gumrahi hai. Phir farmatay ke main har momin ka us ki jaan se zyada dost hun. To jo momin mar kar maal chhor jaye wo us ke ghar walon ka hai. Aur jo qarz ya bachay chhoray to un ki parwarish meri taraf hai aur un ka kharch mujh par hai. (Muslim: 3/12). Baab: Khutba mein ikhtisaar. (Ye aam hai, is par koi takhsees nahi; zaya se murad ayaal hain.)"
"411","[AI-translation] Abu Wail (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ammar (raziyallahu anhu) ne ham par khutba padha aur bohat mukhtasar padha aur nihayat baleegh. Phir jab wo mimbar se utray to ham ne kaha ke Ae Abu Yaqzan! Tum ne bohat baleegh khutba padha aur nihayat mukhtasar kaha. Agar aap is khutba ko zara taweel kartay to behtar hota. Tab Ammar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay, ke aadmi ka namaz ko lamba karna aur khutba ko mukhtasar karna us ke samajh daar honay ki nishani hai, so tum namaz ko lamba kiya karo aur khutba ko chota. Aur baaz bayan jadu hota hai, yani taaseer rakhta hai. (Muslim: 3/12). Baab: Khutba mein kya hazaf nahi ho sakta. (Tanaffasta se murad tool dena hai; mainna se murad nishani hai.)"
"412","[AI-translation] Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas khutba padha aur us ne kaha ke: Jis ne Allah aur us ke Rasool ki itaat ki us ne raah paayi, aur jis ne un donon ki nafarmani ki wo gumrah hua. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu kya bura khateeb hai. Yun kaho ke: Jis ne Allah aur us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki wo gumrah ho gaya. (Muslim: 3/12). Baab: Mimbar par Quran padhna."
"413","[AI-translation] Umm Hisham bint Harisa bin Numan (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Do baras ya aik baras aur kuch maah tak hamara aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka tanoor aik hi tha. Aur main ne Surah Qaaf Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zubaan-e-mubarak se sun kar yaad kar li hai kyunke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Juma ke din khutba irshad farmatay waqt mimbar par us ki tilawat kiya kartay thay. (Muslim: 3/13)"
"414","[AI-translation] Husain se riwayat hai ke Imara bin Ruaiba (raziyallahu anhu) ne Marwan ke betay Bishr ko mimbar par dekha ke wo donon haath, khutba ke dauran ishara ke liye, uthaye hue tha. To kaha ke Allah in donon haathon ko kharab karay, main ne to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke us se zyada na kartay thay aur ungasht-e-shahadat se ishara kiya. (Muslim: 3/13). Baab: Khutba mein ilm sikhana. (Musnad mein hai ke Bishr dua ke waqt haath uthata tha.)"
"415","[AI-translation] Abu Rifaa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas pahuncha aur Wo khutba de rahay thay. Main ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aik ajnabi mard aaya hai jo apne deen ke baaray mein poochna chahta hai, nahi janta ke us ka deen kya hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) meri taraf mutawajjah hue aur apna khutba chhor diya yahan tak ke mere paas pahunche. Phir kursi laayi gayi, main samajhta hun ke us ke paaye lohay ke thay. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us par baith gaye aur mujhe sikhanay lagay us mein se jo Allah ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sikhaya tha. Phir apne khutba ki taraf aaye aur us ka aakhir tamam kiya. (Muslim: 3/15). Baab: Juma mein dono khutbon ke darmiyan baithna."
"416","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kharay ho kar khutba detay, phir baith-tay, phir kharay hotay aur kharay ho kar khutba detay. Jis ne tumhein khabar di ke Wo baith kar khutba detay thay, Allah ki qasam us ne jhoot kaha. Allah ki qasam main ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath do hazaar se zyada namazein padhi hain. (Muslim: 3/9). Baab: Namaz aur khutba halka karna."
"417","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath namaz padhta tha, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz darmiyana hoti aur khutba darmiyana, yani na bohat lamba na chota. (Muslim: 3/11). Baab: Jo Imam ke khutba ke waqt aaye wo do rakat padhay. (Darmiyana se murad na tool-e-zaahir na takhfeef-e-mahiq hai.)"
"418","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) bayan kartay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khutba kharay ho kar padhtay. Phir baith jatay, phir kharay hotay aur kharay kharay padhtay. Aur jis ne tum se kaha ke baith kar padhtay thay, Allah ki qasam us ne jhoot kaha. Aur Allah ki qasam main ne to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath do hazaar se zyada namazein padhi hain. (Muslim: 3/9). (Qasdan darmiyana se murad na bohat lamba na chota hai.)"
"419","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath namazein padhi hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz aur khutba, donon, darmiyanay hotay thay. Yani na bohat lamba na chota. (Muslim: 3/11). Baab: Jo sunay aur khamosh rahay us ki fazilat. (Sulaik ki hadees isi baab mein hai.)"
"420","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sulaik Ghatfani Juma ke din aaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mimbar par baithay thay. Aur Sulaik (raziyallahu anhu) baghair namaz padhay baith gaye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne do rakat padhi? Unhon ne kaha ke nahi, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke utho aur un ko padh lo. (Muslim: 3/14). Baab: Allah ke qaul ke baaray mein: Jab tijarat ya khail dekhtay hain."
"421","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tu Juma ke din apne saathi ko kahay ke chup reh, aur, us waqt, Imam khutba padh raha ho, to tu ne laghw baat ki. (Muslim: 3/5). Baab: Juma ki namaz mein kya padhay."
"422","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jis ne ghusl kiya aur Juma mein aaya aur jitni muqaddar mein thi namaz padhi, phir khutba se farigh honay tak khamosh raha, phir Imam ke saath namaz padhi to us ke is Juma se guzishta Juma tak aur teen din ke aur zyada gunah maaf kar diye jatay hain. (Muslim: 3/8). Baab: Juma ke baad masjid mein namaz."
"423","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum Juma padh chuko to chaar rakat padh lo. Aik doosri riwayat mein ye hai ke agar tumhein kuch jaldi ho to do rakat masjid mein aur do rakat ghar mein laut kar padh lo. (Muslim: 3/17). Baab: Juma ke baad ghar mein namaz."
"424","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab wo, Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu), Juma padh chuktay thay to ghar aa kar do rakat ada kartay aur kehtay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bhi isi tarah kiya kartay thay. (Muslim: 3/17). (Eer se murad ghalla laday oont hain.)"
"425","[AI-translation] Umar bin Ataa kehtay hain ke Nafi bin Jubair ne unhein Saib bin Ukht-e-Namr ke paas wo cheez poochnay ke liye bheja jo Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) ne un ki namaz mein note ki thi. Jab Umar bin Ataa ne ja kar poocha to Saib bin Ukht-e-Namr ne kaha ke haan! Main ne un, Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu), ke saath Maqsoora, jagah ka naam, mein namaz-e-Juma padhi thi. Jab Imam ne namaz se salam phera to main ne apni jagah par kharay ho kar namaz shuru kar di. Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) ne, ghar ya kisi kamray waghera, mein daakhil honay ke baad mujhe bula bheja, aur kaha ke aaj jo kaam tum ne kiya hai aainda na karna. Jab namaz-e-Juma se farigh ho jao to jab tak koi baat cheet na kar lo ya us jagah ko na chhor do, muttasilan namaz na padho. Kyunke Rasool-e-Akram (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein isi baat ka hukm diya hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne is tarah farmaya hai ke ham aik namaz ke baad muttasilan doosri namaz baat cheet kiye baghair ya us jagah ko chhoray baghair na padhein. (Muslim: 3/17). Baab: Juma chhornay par sakhti."
"426","[AI-translation] Hakam bin Mina se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar aur Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhuma) ne un se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne mimbar ki lakriyon par farma rahay thay ke: Log Juma chhor denay se baaz aayein nahi to Allah Taala un ke dilon par muhar laga de aur wo ghafilon mein se ho jayein ge. (Muslim: 3/10). Baab: Eidain mein azaan aur iqamat chhorna."
